WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:04.340
One chunk of honeycomb was placed into the
Clockworks on the setting "Fine."

00:00:04.340 --> 00:00:09.280
The output produced was one ball of wax and
fiber, which exploded into a swarm of animate

00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:12.710
wax bees upon the opening of the output chamber.

00:00:12.710 --> 00:00:16.950
The bees proceeded to attack Junior Researcher
Stan, who was waiting to conduct a test at

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:18.110
the time.

00:00:18.110 --> 00:00:22.289
Upon reaching him, the swarm melted around
his wrist, before taking the shape of a wax

00:00:22.289 --> 00:00:23.289
bracelet.

00:00:23.289 --> 00:00:26.470
The bracelet stung him several times before
becoming inert.

00:00:26.470 --> 00:00:31.250
Researcher Festiv noted, “It seems the bracelet
stingers were made of diamond, likely made

00:00:31.250 --> 00:00:33.730
out of carbon impurities in the honeycomb.”

